          "statement": "+3V3 stays regulated at 3.30 V until U3 (LMR16020PDDAR) reaches its 4.30 V minimum operating VIN, a guaranteed steady-state floor of about 4.80 V at the battery (4.30 V plus the ~0.50 V series path), with the LMR16020 EN UVLO falling at 4.50 V."
