          "statement": "Every PSU capacitor is rated above the clamp voltage of its rail: C2, C5 (/12V_PROT), C7 (/VBOOST), C8 and C10 (U3 soft-start and bootstrap) are 50 V X7R, C6 is the 50 V hybrid polymer and C12 is 16 V on +5V."
