    "scope": "Captured fome-mc psu.kicad_sch at df304f3 without the CAN transceivers (31 parts), on an original standalone board: J1 supplies /12V_RAW and GND, J2 exposes the protected and regulated rails, J3 the CAN buses, and an mcu stub the power-good and CAN logic nets. Judge the block's input protection, reverse-battery block, LMR16020 buck, TLS115D0E sensor supplies, TLV757P 3.3 V LDO and capacitor selection against requirements.md, which restates fome-mc docs/DESIGN.md section 6.3 and the docs/BLOCK_LIBRARY.md power supply entry. block-contract.json cites those documents by pinned commit, path, Git blob and SHA-256 and carries none of their bytes. No layout is captured."
